        "message": "\n\nI have successfully completed all the tasks for handling the invoice dispute:\n\n## Summary of Actions Taken:\n\n### 1. ✅ Read Dispute Message from Slack\nFound the dispute alert in the #billing-disputes channel with the following details:\n- **Invoice:** INV-2024-1847\n- **Disputed Amount:** $12,400\n- **Reason:** Duplicate charge - customer claims this invoice was already paid in November\n- **Customer Contact:** finance@novastarindustries.com\n\n### 2. ✅ Found NovaStar Industries Account\nLocated the account in CRM:\n- **Account ID:** a0d96d32-fca3-5b20-8a2e-9c2a46880706\n- **Industry:** Manufacturing\n- **Location:** Detroit, USA\n\n### 3. ✅ Created Case Record\nCreated Case #92 with:\n- **Title:** Invoice Dispute - NovaStar Industries INV-2024-1847\n- **Priority:** P1 (High)\n- **Status:** Open_New\n- **Case ID:** f1de377f-a817-931f-bc4b-6acf4f0ff90d\n- **Linked Account:** NovaStar Industries\n\n### 4. ✅ Included Dispute Details in Case Description\nThe case description includes:\n- Invoice Number: INV-2024-1847\n- Disputed Amount: $12,400\n- Reason: Duplicate charge - customer claims this invoice was already paid in November\n- Customer Contact: finance@novastarindustries.com\n\n### 5. ✅ Sent Acknowledgment Email\nSuccessfully sent acknowledgment email to finance@novastarindustries.com with:\n- Subject: \"Invoice Dispute Acknowledgment - INV-2024-1847\"\n- Confirmation of dispute receipt\n- Case reference number (#92)\n- Details of the dispute under investigation\n- Professional tone confirming timely resolution\n\nAll tasks have been completed successfully. The dispute is now properly documented in the CRM system and the customer has been notified."
